{
  "meta": {
    "truth": "04-工程规格书.md §5.3 播放队列构建与 §5.4 排序与空值规则（含 R09/R10 裁决，2026-10-05 冻结）",
    "shuffle_algorithm": "SplitMix64(seed)：state=(state+0x9E3779B97F4A7C15) mod 2^64; z=state; z=(z^(z>>30))*0xBF58476D1CE4E5B9; z=(z^(z>>27))*0x94D049BB133111EB; z=z^(z>>31)。Fisher-Yates：i 从 n-1 降至 1，j = next() mod (i+1)，交换 a[i]/a[j]。双端必须逐位实现同一算法，保证同 seed 同序列（U17，A6）。",
    "note": "双端测试必须消费本文件，禁止各自另写期望值。manual 模式：manual_order 非空者先按 manual_order 升序，manual_order 为 NULL 的动态新增项排后，组内按 (captured_at NULLS LAST, id)（R10）。browse 为浏览排序 (COALESCE(captured_at, imported_at), id)（R09）。bucket 为时间筛选分组：分桶键按 UTC 年月 YYYY-MM（展示层时区映射不在本向量范围），无 captured_at 项归入 no_captured_time，不参与年月分桶。时间戳为 epoch 毫秒。",
    "order_modes": ["captured_asc", "manual", "random"]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "QUE-01",
      "note": "播放 captured_asc：captured_at NULLS LAST，同键按 id 升序",
      "order_mode": "captured_asc",
      "random_seed": 0,
      "assets": [
        {"id": "a1", "captured_at": 100, "imported_at": 50, "manual_order": null, "added_at": 1},
        {"id": "a2", "captured_at": null, "imported_at": 10, "manual_order": null, "added_at": 2},
        {"id": "a3", "captured_at": 100, "imported_at": 60, "manual_order": null, "added_at": 3}
      ],
      "expected": ["a1", "a3", "a2"]
    },
